# Electrolysis products follow time
register lv2
add v1 water 250mL
add v1 Na2SO4 0.001mol
electrolyse v1 0.2A 15s
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 250mL
add v2 Na2SO4 0.001mol
electrolyse v2 0.2A 30s
inspect v2
new
add v3 water 250mL
add v3 Na2SO4 0.001mol
electrolyse v3 0.2A 60s
inspect v3
new
add v4 water 250mL
add v4 Na2SO4 0.001mol
electrolyse v4 0.2A 120s
inspect v4
# Ideal Faraday-law production omits efficiency, overpotential and gas capture.
